# Every text file is stored with LF in the repository, whatever the
# platform or editor that wrote it. Without this, Windows tooling silently
# turned 24 files to CRLF and two to a mix, and any whole-file rewrite then
# showed up as tens of thousands of changed lines -- which made concurrent
# branches conflict on every line of crates/gitpoulpi-tui/src/lib.rs.
* text=auto eol=lf
